==Battleground==
*10 [[Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*10 [[Snache]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 20~22 seconds<sup>600f~660f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dragon League Swordsman (Enemy)|Dragon League Swordsmen]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~27.33 seconds<sup>800f~820f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Snache]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Dragon League Swordsman (Enemy)|Dragon League Swordsmen]] spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**1 [[Dragon League Swordsman (Enemy)|Dragon League Swordsman]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

